## Acquisition sequence

Verified prepared image/reader hashes and handset identity before:
  fastboot -s 00001EB100006FAB boot target/pbl-lab/boot-pbl.img
Result: download OKAY0.166s, boot OKAY0.168s. Destination release, SoC116,
CPU0, RAM map, kexec DT marker and devmem were verified over ADB. The minimal
BusyBox has no zcat applet; config.gz was retrieved and decompressed on host.

  adb -s 00001EB100006FAB push target/pbl-lab/physread /run/physread
The upload reported completion but did not exit within20s. No physical read
had run at that point. Fastboot remained healthy, and these commands proved
that the complete correct helper reached RAM:
  fastboot -s 00001EB100006FAB oem cat:/run/physread
  fastboot -s 00001EB100006FAB get_staged physread-readback
  cmp target/pbl-lab/physread physread-readback
  fastboot -s 00001EB100006FAB oem 'shell:chmod 0755 /run/physread'

