  5097189bc623493f9c8ffcbdff08fa407cc087a2673ccabac9e148f93c1ddffd
This also matches the earlier fixed-BOOT readback in cf2ebd6's evidence.
Only RAM/proc/sysfs/devtmpfs/configfs/functionfs mounts were present.

